review_comments.body:
**Missing graceful shutdown handler** — As a template that others will extend, the `main()` function should register SIGTERM/SIGINT listeners to drain in-flight requests before exit. Without this, Docker `docker stop` sends SIGTERM and the Node process exits immediately, potentially dropping active requests.

```typescript
const shutdown = async (signal: string) => {
  fastify.log.info(`Received ${signal}, shutting down gracefully...`);
  await fastify.close();
  process.exit(0);
};
process.on("SIGTERM", () => shutdown("SIGTERM"));
process.on("SIGINT", () => shutdown("SIGINT"));
```

